# Play Your Part — environment
#
# Copy to .env.local and fill in. `.env.local` is gitignored, so a fresh clone
# has no environment at all and the app will fail to reach Supabase until this
# file is copied and filled.
#
#   cp .env.example .env.local
#
# Values may be quoted or unquoted; the helper scripts strip surrounding quotes.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Supabase — REQUIRED. Without these the app builds but every page that reads
# data fails, and the Learn tab shows "Could not load modules".
#
# Dashboard → Project Settings → API.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL="https://<project-ref>.supabase.co"
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY="<anon / publishable key>"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Database connection — only needed to APPLY content, never at runtime.
#
# Used by `npm run seed:apply` to push supabase/seed_modules.sql. The anon key
# above cannot do this: learning_modules has a single RLS policy, for SELECT.
#
# Dashboard → Project Settings → Database → Connection string → Session pooler.
# Use the pooler host; db.<ref>.supabase.co is IPv6-only and will not resolve
# from most machines.
#
# Leave this out for normal development.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SUPABASE_DB_URL="postgresql://postgres.<ref>:<password>@aws-0-<region>.pooler.supabase.com:6543/postgres"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AI — OPTIONAL. Everything works without it.
#
# Module grading is deliberately not dependent on a model: the deterministic
# cue matcher extracts signals and the rubric is applied in code, so feedback
# stays correct and personalized with no key set. A key only widens signal
# recall on module grading, and restores the Daily Challenge coach's prose
# (without one it returns a placeholder score labelled "Coach Unavailable").
#
# GROQ_API_KEY is preferred and wins if both are set.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GROQ_API_KEY=""
OPENAI_API_KEY=""
